      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.1cor.bohairic_ed:4",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲱ ⲡⲥⲟⲛ ⲉⲕⲱⲣⲕ ⲉⲕϫⲓϭⲟⲗ ⲉⲕϫⲁϫⲱ ϩⲙⲡⲉⲕ**ϫⲓ** ⲙⲛⲡⲉⲕϯ ·",
      "english": "O brother, thou takest oaths, thou utterest lies and thou shewest thyself hard and grasping in thy buying and selling;",
