      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:psephrem.asceticon.budge:24-55",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲕⲁⲛ ⲉϣⲱⲡ ⲁⲥϣⲁⲛⲫⲱⲣϫ ⲙⲁⲣⲉⲥⲟϩⲓ ⲛⲟⲩⲉϣⲉⲛ**ϭⲓ** ⲙⲙⲟⲛ ⲙⲁⲣⲉⲥϩⲱⲧⲡ ⲉⲡⲉⲥϩⲁⲓ ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲡⲓϩⲁⲓ ⲛⲧⲉϥϣⲧⲉⲙⲭⲁϯⲥϩⲓⲙⲓ .",
      "english": "(but if she departs, let her remain unmarried, or else be reconciled to her husband), and that the husband not leave his wife.",
      "source": "Bohairic 1 Corinthians 7 (Digital Edition)",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.1cor.bohairic_ed:7",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲛⲁⲓⲁⲧϥ ⲙⲡⲉⲧⲛⲁⲥⲃⲧⲱⲧϥ · ϫⲉⲉϥⲉ**ϫⲓ** ⲙⲡⲱⲛϩ ϣⲁⲉⲛⲉϩ ⁛—",
      "english": "Blessed is the man who shall make himself ready, for he shall receive the life which is for ever!",
